Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Grid Search", "Chapter",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.002357812880436*^9, 
  4.0023578178116455`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d076368d-8b94-4e48-b734-\
bf344c85f167"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "In this Chapter the hyperparameter space is explored along a grid. This \
approach grants a relatively rigorous search over the selected volume, hence \
allowing the study of chosen combinations of parameters.\n\nMultiple \
functions are defined:\n\t- RunLine: run FindQNM (see previous Chapter)  over \
a 1D list of parameters sets, i.e. {{p1, q1,...},{p2,q2,...},...};\n\t- \
GridSearchECO: run RunLine over a 2D parameter grid;\n\t- GridSearch: simple \
exploration over a grid where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[Omega]", "guess"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8d01823f-c872-fd4b-bc5e-47bc81940fce"],
 " is fixed (hence most parameters defining the CO as well)."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0032195394815083`*^9, 4.0032197327316647`*^9}, {
  4.0032948953550987`*^9, 4.0032949262026176`*^9}, {4.0033142625715656`*^9, 
  4.0033143120344505`*^9}, {4.003314346082409*^9, 4.0033145387033806`*^9}, {
  4.0033146752059193`*^9, 4.0033146756545563`*^9}, {4.0033156047818184`*^9, 
  4.003315697789465*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"cf1d0d9b-0999-684e-9224-\
f399db84a429"],

