Cell[TextData[{
 "OUTPUT FILE\n\nData format: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"N", "\[Times]", "M"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c1ec8ad5-2cd6-e741-9ad8-e6a24503c563"],
 " matrix with elements {\[Eta], \[Epsilon], Re[\[Omega]], Im[\[Eta]], \
check}, where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"N", "=", 
    RowBox[{"Length", "[", "ai", "]"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8258021e-62d3-4d41-add3-be7c671bc33a"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"M", "=", 
    RowBox[{"Length", "[", "aj", "]"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "522d9c86-c4d5-3540-9cb1-0cc438f2725c"],
 ". \n\t`ai` is the initialization parameter and `aj` is the parallel \
parameter (i.e. explored in parallel).\nName format:\n\t- Object type : ECO1, \
i.e. non-spinning ECO;\n\t- Parameters : match_inf_ordI-ordE (if equal one is \
omitted);\n\t- Output           : \
h(=\[Eta])_e(=\[Epsilon])_R(=Re[\[Omega]])_I(=Im[\[Omega]])_c(=check);\n\t- \
Two digits code giving information about the integration order as follows:\n\t\
\t\[CenterDot] First and second digits refer respectively to \[Eta] and \
\[Epsilon];\n\t\t\[CenterDot] Exploration from lower to higher \[Rule] +1, \
vice versa \[Rule] +0;\n\t\t\[CenterDot] Parallel parameter +2;\n\t\t\
\[CenterDot] Parameter with values added in successive runs +4 (usually the \
initialization parameter).\n\t- File numeration (i.e. different run and/or \
parameter volume)."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.003482565589369*^9, 4.0034830160482807`*^9}, {
