Cell["Random Search", "Chapter",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0023578347586975`*^9, 
  4.0023578410960064`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b4c72f91-e440-8e4b-9b55-\
5457df3db0c5"],

Cell["\<\
In this Chapter the hyperparameter space is explored randomly. This approach \
allows for a relatively fast search over the selected volume.
The implementation is the following:
\t- RandomSearch: handles sampling, calculation and final output;
\t- See above for IntQNM and FindQNM.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.0029604965863037`*^9, 4.0029605208721313`*^9}, {
  4.002960557944996*^9, 4.002960865374386*^9}, {4.0029608957953568`*^9, 
